          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Hongchao Zhang",
          "email": "hongchao@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-10-19 07:49:14.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Hongchao Zhang",
          "email": "hongchao@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-10-19 07:50:39.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20503 tests: restart grace timer in test_block_soft",
        "message": "LU-20503 tests: restart grace timer in test_block_soft\n\nThe block grace timer starts when the write that crosses the soft\nlimit is issued, and the writes and the quota queries that follow\ncan take longer than the grace time on a loaded system, so the timer\nis already over when the test issues the writes that are expected\nto succeed. The test then measures how fast the filesystem\nis instead of the grace time behaviour, and fails with \"write\nfailure, but expect success\" (test_3b) or \"mmap write failure, but\nexpect success\" (test_3a).\n\nIn the debug logs of the failing run (ZFS 4MDTs/8OSTs, 60s grace)\nthat write is done by dd as ten 1KB writes, and ll_do_tiny_write()\nsends each of them synchronously to the OST (osc_queue_sync_pages()\nwith no DLM lock), which took between 1.4s and 17.9s each, 49s in\ntotal, followed by the mmap write and six lfs quota dumps. The\ngrace timer of that subtest started at 1788773828 and expired at\n1788773888, while the check ran at 1788773897.\n\nRestart the block grace timer of every quota that limits this test\nfile (the global one and each pool one) right before those writes,\nand check that it was running before restarting it, so a master\nthat fails to start it is still reported.\n\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3a,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3b,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3c,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 testlist=sanity-quota \tenv=ONLY=3a,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 testlist=sanity-quota \tenv=ONLY=3b,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 mdtcount=4 ostcount=8 \t testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3c,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nAssisted-by: DeepSeek:V4.1-Flash llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Hongchao Zhang <hongchao@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I10e22f9e6be238733b3824112f624a2262926de9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
